Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:40.47,0:00:41.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,新银河接近
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:41.90,0:00:44.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是属于处女座里的星球之一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:44.40,0:00:46.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有智慧的生命体吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:46.44,0:00:48.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有的话他的智慧程度是?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:48.17,0:00:51.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么画像寻找开始
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:51.94,0:00:55.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,银河周围发现\N高速行进中的不明物体
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:55.21,0:00:56.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,画像扩大
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:56.75,0:00:57.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,画像扩大
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:57.45,0:00:58.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:58.88,0:01:00.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我还没见过这样的宇宙船呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:00.92,0:01:03.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是落伍的交通工具吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:03.49,0:01:05.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像还不够文明
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:05.29,0:01:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 下一个猎物就是那个银河
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:08.43,0:01:12.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,首先先登陆不起眼的无人星\N看看状况吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:12.30,0:01:15.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么进入超时空飞行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:19.84,0:01:22.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂！知道神秘列车吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:22.61,0:01:26.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,目的地有可能是九州、四国\N或北海道很神秘的喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:26.55,0:01:32.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在那儿有各种有趣的活动\N在等着你呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:32.82,0:01:35.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想参加的人实在太多了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:35.02,0:01:37.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,车票虽然很难买
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.36,0:01:39.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但我有3张
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:40.46,0:01:43.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇！另外两个让谁去好呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:43.30,0:01:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让我去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:44.46,0:01:46.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也想去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:46.03,0:01:47.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:47.37,0:01:48.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以嘛...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:48.63,0:01:50.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想大雄一定也很想去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:51.90,0:01:54.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,静香，别管大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:54.81,0:01:58.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喔！你看说曹操曹操就到
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:58.71,0:01:59.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 各位
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:59.95,0:02:02.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起\N神秘列车的车票已没有了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:02.78,0:02:04.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别管这个了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:05.42,0:02:07.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有没有看到哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:07.45,0:02:09.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已经三天没回家了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:09.22,0:02:13.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他从来不会不打声招呼\N就出门的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:13.02,0:02:15.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会不会被车撞到了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:15.13,0:02:17.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是被坏人带走了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:17.63,0:02:20.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们别这么不负责任的乱说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:20.33,0:02:23.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我真的好担心啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:23.34,0:02:25.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,万一如果他发生了什么事的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:25.50,0:02:26.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要怎么办才好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:26.81,0:02:28.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄，别担心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:28.94,0:02:31.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦不可能发生什么事情的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:31.98,0:02:32.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:32.98,0:02:36.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们家的狗“利娜”\N也是一星期后跑回来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:36.05,0:02:38.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可能掉到哪儿去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:38.45,0:02:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对了，可以贴悬赏海报呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:41.55,0:02:46.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,问保健所可能比较快唷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:46.12,0:02:48.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又不是猫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:50.26,0:02:53.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:09.00,0:03:13.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦剧场版 大雄和银河超特急
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:10.00,0:03:11.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这种事情真好\Nこんなこといいな
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:11.85,0:03:13.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以完成更好\Nできたらいいな
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:13.85,0:03:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有那样的　有这样的\Nあんなゆめ　こんなゆめ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:16.00,0:03:19.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有各式各样的梦想\Nいっぱいあるけど
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:19.94,0:03:21.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家　大家　大家啊\Nみんな　みんな　みんな
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:21.75,0:03:23.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来帮我实现愿望啊\Nかなえてくれる
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:23.75,0:03:25.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用那个神奇的口袋\Nふしぎなポッケで
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:25.75,0:03:29.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来帮我实现愿望啊\Nかなえてくれる
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:29.45,0:03:33.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好想自由自在的在天空飞翔\Nそらをじゆうに　とびたいな
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:33.35,0:03:35.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,“来！给你竹蜻蜓！”\N“ハイ！タケコプター”
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:37.35,0:03:38.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊　啊　啊\Nアン　アン　アン
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:38.95,0:03:45.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我最喜欢哆啦A梦了\Nとってもだいすきドラえもん
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:45.10,0:03:46.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊　啊　啊\Nアン　アン　アン
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:46.65,0:03:52.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我最喜欢哆啦A梦了\Nとってもだいすきドラえもん
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:13.75,0:04:15.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我回来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:16.55,0:04:17.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你去哪里了啊?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:17.72,0:04:19.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦在找你呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:19.55,0:04:22.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊！哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:22.32,0:04:24.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄先把晚饭吃了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:24.09,0:04:25.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:25.09,0:04:26.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:26.39,0:04:30.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么晚了你去哪儿啦?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:30.13,0:04:32.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这才是我要问你的呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:32.76,0:04:35.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我很担心你嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:35.13,0:04:37.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起 对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:37.00,0:04:39.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我去了一下22世纪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:39.84,0:04:40.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去做什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:40.94,0:04:43.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拿到了一样好东西喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:43.07,0:04:44.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的?是什么好东西?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:44.68,0:04:48.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是现在最有人气的22世纪\N银河超特急的车票
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:48.88,0:04:51.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,22世纪银河超特急的车票?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:51.92,0:04:55.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对啊！排了3天才拿到手的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:56.02,0:04:59.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看 明天晚上出发的车票
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:03.29,0:05:07.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,列车是银河超特急的神秘列车
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:07.80,0:05:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从银河的中心出发
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:09.80,0:05:13.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但不知道目的地是哪里喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:13.54,0:05:16.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为这样才会有期待感
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:16.84,0:05:18.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也很想邀请你们去的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:18.84,0:05:21.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是好像行程有点重复的样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:22.58,0:05:24.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太空旅行好像很好玩耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:24.88,0:05:28.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊啊\N早知道就不要做无聊的约定了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:29.49,0:05:32.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那又怎样呢 一点也不好玩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:32.26,0:05:34.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,宇宙是很危险的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:34.09,0:05:37.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又黑又暗也没有空气
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:37.30,0:05:39.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,搞不好会被宇宙人抓去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:39.86,0:05:42.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定也会被流星撞到
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:44.24,0:05:49.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,与其这样在地面上走\N还是绝对安全的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:49.24,0:05:50.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也这么认为
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:50.84,0:05:52.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:54.65,0:05:56.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到目前为止还没有听说过
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:56.92,0:05:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,银河超特急有发生过任何事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:59.05,0:06:02.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说到宇宙船也只不过像\N游览船一样的东西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:02.69,0:06:06.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在以前是重要的大众交通工具
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:06.32,0:06:08.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为发明了任意门
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:08.33,0:06:11.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以才被利用为\N观光的交通工具
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:11.93,0:06:14.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,保证绝对安全
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:14.10,0:06:15.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来是这样的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:15.40,0:06:17.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那样花几天的时间呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:17.64,0:06:18.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:18.90,0:06:20.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样不是很伤脑的吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:20.34,0:06:21.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为银河是很宽广的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:21.61,0:06:24.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过你大可不用担心这些
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:24.68,0:06:28.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不论去哪里都可用任意门回家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:28.15,0:06:31.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以白天去学校\N晚上就去宇宙旅行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:31.65,0:06:32.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你觉得如何呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:32.98,0:06:34.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:34.12,0:06:36.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:36.35,0:06:37.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好期待喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:37.52,0:06:40.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,夜晚怎么不赶快来呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:47.20,0:06:49.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到银河底端了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:49.57,0:06:52.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,首先寻找没有住生物的星球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:55.84,0:06:59.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个星球只有岩石\N没有多细胞生物
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:59.61,0:07:02.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很好 马上设立基地
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:06.55,0:07:11.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,牙膏、牙刷、毛巾、零食和漫画
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:11.79,0:07:13.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不需要带那些东西的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:13.69,0:07:15.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧 大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:15.03,0:07:16.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别忘了关灯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:16.69,0:07:18.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:19.16,0:07:20.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,窗户也关起来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:20.03,0:07:23.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好，不要被妈妈发现
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:24.04,0:07:25.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,车站在哪里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:25.57,0:07:27.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会到后山来等我们
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:36.85,0:07:39.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的会来这里接我们吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:39.68,0:07:42.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对，刚好晚上12点的时候到
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:42.59,0:07:45.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,天空中铁道是很准确的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:45.96,0:07:46.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不知道怎么了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:46.93,0:07:47.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,心脏跳得好快呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:47.99,0:07:50.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对啊 兴奋的说不出话来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:50.06,0:07:51.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇 好像在作梦喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:51.96,0:07:53.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 别睡着啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:58.20,0:07:59.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:59.40,0:08:00.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:17.12,0:08:19.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇 好棒呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:19.60,0:08:21.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:29.27,0:08:31.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的在空中行走吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:31.97,0:08:34.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对呀 很帅吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:34.54,0:08:35.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,赶快坐上去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:35.57,0:08:38.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们是7号车厢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:39.24,0:08:40.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里，晚安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:40.98,0:08:42.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,晚安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:44.52,0:08:46.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 您好\N- 您好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:47.69,0:08:50.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇，这什么东西啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:50.05,0:08:52.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,里面比从外面看起来要大得多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:52.42,0:08:55.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是特别空间有5间单人房
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:55.23,0:08:56.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有会议室
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:56.86,0:08:59.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:59.06,0:09:01.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,里面设施都能用吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:01.10,0:09:05.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,车长 从地球上车的有2个喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:05.27,0:09:07.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像没人在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:08.37,0:09:10.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 要开车了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:39.84,0:09:42.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,车长、司机都不在\N但列车在移动着耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:58.76,0:10:01.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看地球变成那样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:11.67,0:10:12.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样好吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:12.57,0:10:13.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没跟他们打招呼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:13.81,0:10:14.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没关系的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:14.57,0:10:17.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们可是有买车票的喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:17.14,0:10:19.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,静香他们若来了就好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:19.31,0:10:20.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有5间房间嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:20.65,0:10:21.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:21.48,0:10:23.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,早知道就请他们也来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:23.82,0:10:24.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没办法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:24.82,0:10:27.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就今晚享受一下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:27.29,0:10:28.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要哪间房间?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:28.72,0:10:30.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要1号房
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:30.02,0:10:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我选旁边的2号房
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:32.56,0:10:33.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么待会儿见
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:34.99,0:10:36.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇 里面这么宽咧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:36.76,0:10:38.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有床啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:40.30,0:10:41.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好棒呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:41.90,0:10:44.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢您乘坐本列车
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:44.37,0:10:46.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要您喝了这瓶宇宙饮料
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:46.57,0:10:48.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不论在宇宙的任何温度环境下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:48.51,0:10:52.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,您都能舒舒服服的适应它
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:53.95,0:10:55.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以在宇宙生存的呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:55.75,0:10:57.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,咦?这个按键是什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:58.95,0:11:01.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇 可以看见外面耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:03.09,0:11:04.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,咦 红色星星
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:04.02,0:11:05.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,应该是火星吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:05.89,0:11:05.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么快就不见了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:05.92,0:11:07.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么快就不见了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:07.63,0:11:10.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要不要去展望车厢看看?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:10.13,0:11:12.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯，要去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:12.26,0:11:14.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,展望车厢在哪儿呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:14.07,0:11:17.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在58号车厢 所以嘛...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:17.00,0:11:18.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,58号车厢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:18.74,0:11:20.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从外面看只有8个车厢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:20.67,0:11:23.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但实际上这列车有120个车厢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:23.14,0:11:25.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有120个车厢呀?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:28.41,0:11:31.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去展望车厢\N就像参加运动会一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:35.19,0:11:37.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等、等一下嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:39.62,0:11:42.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跑慢一点儿嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:44.70,0:11:47.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:47.06,0:11:49.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了，大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:49.07,0:11:49.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看窗户
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:49.87,0:11:50.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有一个忍者
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:50.94,0:11:52.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:53.50,0:11:57.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,宇宙里怎么会有忍者呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:57.41,0:12:00.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是太累了吧，看到幻象了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:00.04,0:12:01.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来，竹蜻蜓给你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:01.48,0:12:04.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么不早点拿出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:04.42,0:12:08.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过在车厢里用竹蜻蜓真好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:10.02,0:12:11.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么豪华的地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:11.06,0:12:12.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里就是展望车厢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:12.72,0:12:14.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好漂亮啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:14.56,0:12:15.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,坐下来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:15.76,0:12:17.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:17.36,0:12:18.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么漂亮的景色
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:18.86,0:12:21.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真想给静香看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:22.80,0:12:24.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,回去后可以说给她听啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:24.77,0:12:25.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:27.07,0:12:28.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:28.41,0:12:29.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是木星
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:29.87,0:12:32.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,木星? 好大唷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:33.91,0:12:36.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它是太阳系里最大的惑星
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:36.78,0:12:38.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来如此
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:41.25,0:12:42.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,地球来的客人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:42.29,0:12:43.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,欢迎欢迎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:43.52,0:12:45.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请让我看看你们的车票
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:45.99,0:12:47.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你就是车长吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:47.56,0:12:49.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么到现在才出现啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:49.69,0:12:51.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为总公司叫我回去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:51.60,0:12:53.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,回来晚了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:53.06,0:12:54.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:54.97,0:12:58.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其他大约还有600位的客人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:58.77,0:13:01.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为旅途遥远
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:01.17,0:13:03.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以现在在房间里休息
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:03.84,0:13:07.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,或是用任意门出去办事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:09.08,0:13:10.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要不要喝点果汁?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:10.75,0:13:11.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果要用餐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:11.88,0:13:14.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也可以送到房间里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:14.15,0:13:15.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:28.17,0:13:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,木星通过了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:29.80,0:13:31.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开始时空跳跃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:36.97,0:13:38.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么都看不到
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:38.44,0:13:40.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会维持一段时间
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:40.58,0:13:42.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,回房间去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:42.38,0:13:43.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从这儿开始
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:43.58,0:13:46.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会出现特殊效果星际影像
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:47.00,0:13:48.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我好困哟
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:48.25,0:13:49.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我好困哟 下一次吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:49.69,0:13:50.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就这么决定
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:50.86,0:13:52.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们回房间了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:52.49,0:13:53.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,晚安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:58.96,0:14:00.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去展望车厢看看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:00.13,0:14:02.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的有其他的客人耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:03.70,0:14:04.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,晚安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:04.74,0:14:05.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明天见
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:08.21,0:14:09.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小便后睡觉吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:13.74,0:14:14.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也附有浴室
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:14.81,0:14:16.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是豪华啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:28.59,0:14:31.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看镜子里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:31.43,0:14:32.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:32.73,0:14:33.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,咦?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:33.66,0:14:35.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,刚刚有人在呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:35.40,0:14:37.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你再仔细看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:37.27,0:14:38.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一个人都没有呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:38.57,0:14:40.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但我真的看到了嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:40.34,0:14:42.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那在别的房间睡吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:42.11,0:14:44.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,胆小鬼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:44.38,0:14:46.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜托，让我和你一起睡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:46.31,0:14:48.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其他还有很多房间啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:48.65,0:14:49.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一个人睡太可怕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:49.85,0:14:51.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会睡不着的嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:53.42,0:14:56.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄你有点分寸好不好?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:05.70,0:15:07.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄，起来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:07.70,0:15:08.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,回家啰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:10.64,0:15:12.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再让我睡一下嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:12.47,0:15:14.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,学校会迟到喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:14.67,0:15:16.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 学校
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:16.34,0:15:18.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下课后再来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:18.58,0:15:19.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:20.44,0:15:21.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我回来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:22.51,0:15:24.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄，起来了吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:24.78,0:15:26.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,起来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:31.62,0:15:33.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就好像全包下来的一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:33.92,0:15:37.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又舒服，服务又好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:37.29,0:15:38.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从展望车看出去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:38.53,0:15:40.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,木星、土星真是漂亮
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:40.77,0:15:44.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真期待今天晚上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:44.14,0:15:47.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们的旅行团是今天晚上吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:47.24,0:15:49.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么，请期待着吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:49.57,0:15:50.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再见
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:55.45,0:15:57.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么你们两个都不说话呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:57.52,0:16:00.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果有意见的话\N说出来不就得了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:00.62,0:16:03.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们一定认为\N早知道就应该去那里的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:03.02,0:16:03.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不对?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:03.75,0:16:05.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就去呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:05.82,0:16:08.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是一个人也可以的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:08.09,0:16:08.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但相反的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:08.96,0:16:11.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要再认为我们是朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:11.30,0:16:13.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们真讨厌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:13.56,0:16:14.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下，小夫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:14.83,0:16:17.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啰唆！真啰唆
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:18.44,0:16:20.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么他那么生气呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:24.34,0:16:28.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧！我去拜托大雄看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:28.38,0:16:29.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:31.85,0:16:32.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,晚安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:34.82,0:16:37.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好朋友 其实有事要麻烦你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:37.35,0:16:39.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道，正等你们呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:39.12,0:16:39.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,赶快进来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:39.99,0:16:41.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:41.19,0:16:44.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,技安，还是先拒绝小夫再说吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:44.03,0:16:46.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别管那家伙了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:46.53,0:16:48.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,打扰了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:48.60,0:16:50.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈妈，我们要商讨功课的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:50.57,0:16:51.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要吵我们喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:51.97,0:16:53.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,打扰了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:53.50,0:16:54.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:54.54,0:16:55.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么晚了还要研究功课
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:55.71,0:16:57.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真辛苦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:57.01,0:16:58.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:58.88,0:17:01.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其实我们是瞒着小夫来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:01.25,0:17:04.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 嗨！\N- 哇！你这家伙...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:04.38,0:17:05.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我先来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:05.22,0:17:06.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,反叛者
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:06.35,0:17:08.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你还不是一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:08.25,0:17:09.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 揍死你\N- 不要吵了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:16.39,0:17:18.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里就是银河超特急
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:18.73,0:17:20.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里是列车里头?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:20.80,0:17:22.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像饭店喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:22.33,0:17:23.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好漂亮
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:23.37,0:17:25.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我去向车长付帐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:25.47,0:17:27.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,先进去房间里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:27.84,0:17:29.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要5号房
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:29.21,0:17:30.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我4号房
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:30.81,0:17:32.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我3号房
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:32.71,0:17:34.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,行李放好后
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:34.15,0:17:35.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就去展望车厢吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:35.18,0:17:36.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:36.78,0:17:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在会议室等你们喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:40.12,0:17:41.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家一定会吓一大跳的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:54.87,0:17:56.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇！技安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:57.57,0:18:00.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?有西部牛仔?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:00.40,0:18:02.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这种家伙交给我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:05.21,0:18:07.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,咦，没有人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:07.04,0:18:09.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,刚刚明明开枪了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:09.51,0:18:10.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用手枪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:10.65,0:18:12.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么，大惊小怪的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:12.25,0:18:13.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,胆小鬼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:13.18,0:18:15.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的开枪了嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:18.19,0:18:19.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真奇怪啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:19.69,0:18:22.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,忍者、镜中人、西部牛仔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:22.35,0:18:24.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到底是什么呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:24.26,0:18:25.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:25.83,0:18:26.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:26.73,0:18:27.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已经准备好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:27.77,0:18:29.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去展望车厢吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:29.37,0:18:31.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧 走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:31.77,0:18:33.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也找另外两个人去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:33.17,0:18:34.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:34.04,0:18:35.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们先去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:35.77,0:18:37.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在正有趣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:41.48,0:18:44.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也有立体电动耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:44.15,0:18:46.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这列车的服务真好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:47.95,0:18:50.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,特意跑来这里却不去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:50.32,0:18:51.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那也没办法啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:51.92,0:18:54.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,静香真替人着想啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:55.16,0:18:56.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,展望车厢很远嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:57.09,0:18:58.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:00.23,0:19:01.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下一个车厢就是展望车厢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:04.97,0:19:06.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如何?这么漂亮的景色
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:06.97,0:19:09.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,漂亮的景色?在哪儿?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:09.21,0:19:11.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,展望车厢不见
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:11.24,0:19:13.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄，到底是怎么了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:13.21,0:19:15.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也不晓得呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:24.69,0:19:26.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄，振作一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:26.09,0:19:27.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:27.49,0:19:30.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了?我帮他看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:32.10,0:19:35.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不用担心，轻微脑震荡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:35.53,0:19:36.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,稍微让他躺一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:36.90,0:19:38.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就会醒的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:38.14,0:19:39.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:39.47,0:19:42.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么突然变亮了呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:42.67,0:19:46.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,新生的宇宙爆炸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:46.08,0:19:46.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也就是说...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:46.94,0:19:48.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,特殊假想画像
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:48.11,0:19:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大银河诞生的开始
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:51.15,0:19:52.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,列车进入超时空跳跃时
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:52.98,0:19:54.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会显像出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:57.15,0:19:59.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄，你醒了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:59.26,0:20:00.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:00.62,0:20:02.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是哪里?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:02.53,0:20:04.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,展望车厢哟
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:04.33,0:20:07.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是特殊想像画像
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:09.07,0:20:10.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,宇宙时代
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:10.77,0:20:13.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,持续了10万年
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:16.04,0:20:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们的银河是处女座
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:20.04,0:20:23.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,完全搞不懂在说什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:25.58,0:20:27.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,回房去玩电动吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:27.25,0:20:29.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想多待一会儿
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:29.62,0:20:32.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我去找哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:35.99,0:20:38.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比昨晚热闹多了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:39.13,0:20:40.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦去哪了呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:41.63,0:20:42.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:42.30,0:20:43.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫怎么了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:44.40,0:20:44.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,出现了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:44.94,0:20:45.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么出现了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:45.77,0:20:49.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,海...贼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:49.87,0:20:50.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,海贼?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:50.57,0:20:54.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对啊，刚刚看到海贼的出现
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:54.85,0:20:55.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,果然没错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:55.81,0:20:57.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你也看到了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:57.75,0:21:00.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊...技安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:00.48,0:21:05.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恐...恐龙出现了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:05.12,0:21:06.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恐龙?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:06.46,0:21:08.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他把玻璃打破探进头了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:08.73,0:21:09.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:09.93,0:21:12.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可能还在也说不定
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:13.50,0:21:15.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有人在呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:16.17,0:21:18.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哪里的窗户被打破了呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:18.34,0:21:19.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:19.30,0:21:20.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,咦?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:20.17,0:21:21.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的看到了嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:21.37,0:21:23.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不相信我就揍你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:23.47,0:21:25.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有人说不相信啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:25.18,0:21:28.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我刚刚也说\N看到了西部牛仔啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:28.05,0:21:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也看到了海贼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:30.01,0:21:33.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,赶快通知哆啦A梦去查查看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:35.52,0:21:36.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,静香
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:37.99,0:21:39.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没看到哆啦A梦吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:39.42,0:21:41.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没来这里哟
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:41.13,0:21:43.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那会去哪儿呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:53.10,0:21:54.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:55.81,0:21:57.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家都在啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:57.44,0:21:58.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你去哪里了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:58.51,0:21:59.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们在找你啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:59.94,0:22:01.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不得了了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:01.08,0:22:03.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,详细情形到会议室再说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:03.51,0:22:04.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到底怎么了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:04.52,0:22:05.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,发生什么事情?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:05.75,0:22:07.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:07.58,0:22:09.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 发生什么事\N- 有事吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:09.15,0:22:10.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是这样的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:10.39,0:22:13.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,总公司来了一个紧急通知
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:15.99,0:22:18.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?盗贼团?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:18.30,0:22:21.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对！神秘黑色影团
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:21.17,0:22:22.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,随着宇宙边缘的运转
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:22.90,0:22:25.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,犯罪者将无人的小惑星
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:25.80,0:22:26.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当作基地
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:26.80,0:22:30.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用海贼船来到处捣乱发威
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:30.54,0:22:32.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没听说啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:32.11,0:22:33.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们还一直相信这是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:33.74,0:22:35.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很安全的旅行团呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:35.15,0:22:37.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在我们该怎么办呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:37.11,0:22:39.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,回到房间里锁上房门
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:39.32,0:22:41.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,向上天祈祷吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:41.45,0:22:43.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,亏你们还敢邀请我们来啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:43.65,0:22:44.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:44.92,0:22:46.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可不是我拜托你们来的呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:46.96,0:22:48.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:48.79,0:22:51.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想回家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:53.76,0:22:54.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊，对了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:54.83,0:22:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们可以用任意门回去啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:57.90,0:23:00.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊，对啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:00.07,0:23:02.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么没想到这一点呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:02.11,0:23:03.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,黑色影团若来的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:03.11,0:23:04.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要车长及旅客都不在的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:04.54,0:23:06.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们也没办法呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:07.74,0:23:11.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等黑色影团通过了银河后
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:11.05,0:23:13.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们再来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:13.08,0:23:14.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:14.12,0:23:16.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么请吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:18.86,0:23:20.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,门里的超空间
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:20.52,0:23:22.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被黑色影团给上锁了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:22.29,0:23:24.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是他们做的好事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:25.80,0:23:29.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有人能从这个列车逃出去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:36.17,0:23:37.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,列车好像从时空跳跃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:37.77,0:23:40.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,出来到宇宙了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:43.45,0:23:47.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,列车全速前进通过小惑星群
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:47.08,0:23:49.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会持续急转弯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:49.92,0:23:51.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请小心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:58.90,0:24:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈妈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:03.10,0:24:05.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们到底会变成怎样呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:10.34,0:24:11.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂，各位
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:11.54,0:24:13.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们不觉得\N终于变得有趣了吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:14.98,0:24:18.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们从以前都一直冒险过来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:18.35,0:24:21.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不论遇到什么都会奋战到底
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:21.08,0:24:22.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这次也是一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:22.32,0:24:23.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不能逃，跟他们拼到底吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:23.99,0:24:25.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄每次都会忽然讲一些
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:25.39,0:24:27.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很帅气的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:27.46,0:24:29.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,讲得好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:29.03,0:24:30.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们如果进攻过来的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:30.39,0:24:31.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们就拼吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:32.20,0:24:33.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:33.63,0:24:37.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟坏人拼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:39.17,0:24:41.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,穿透环
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:41.77,0:24:45.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我和大雄到车顶察看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:45.01,0:24:46.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:48.28,0:24:49.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,危险
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:49.91,0:24:51.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:51.85,0:24:53.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为是宇宙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:53.15,0:24:54.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以竹蜻蜓是行不通的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:54.85,0:24:55.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:55.45,0:24:56.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:56.29,0:24:59.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄小心点哟
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:59.72,0:25:01.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我记得有一样好东西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:01.69,0:25:04.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,止滑手套和鞋子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:04.90,0:25:06.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,穿上就没问题了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:06.26,0:25:08.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这好像青蛙一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:08.37,0:25:10.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧，到前面看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:20.24,0:25:21.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,咦，有人在那儿
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:24.78,0:25:26.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊，车长
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:26.22,0:25:28.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,客人，很危险的呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:28.69,0:25:32.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但你在这里\N列车行进没问题吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:32.59,0:25:34.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为是自动运行的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:37.19,0:25:39.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各位也来乘凉的吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:39.33,0:25:40.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是刚刚的...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:40.83,0:25:42.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是巴姆
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:42.17,0:25:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是报社记者
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:43.97,0:25:45.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是野比大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:45.97,0:25:49.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是猫型机器人哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:49.34,0:25:50.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请指教
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:50.37,0:25:53.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,报社记者为何在这列车上?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:53.14,0:25:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好不容易来度假
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:56.35,0:25:59.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,却遭遇到这种事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:59.45,0:26:00.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:00.12,0:26:01.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,星星在发光
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:01.32,0:26:02.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那里一个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:02.39,0:26:03.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里也有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:03.62,0:26:05.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那一个一个星星的后面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:05.39,0:26:07.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都躲着黑色影团
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:07.42,0:26:08.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,互相发出信号
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:08.83,0:26:10.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下就会攻过来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:11.76,0:26:12.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有炮弹啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:12.86,0:26:14.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是信号弹而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:14.30,0:26:16.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但总比没有得好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:20.54,0:26:21.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:34.72,0:26:35.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让我来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:35.89,0:26:38.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这可不是玩具呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:38.66,0:26:41.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然大雄没有其他优点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:41.02,0:26:44.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但却是射击的天才哟
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:48.57,0:26:50.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,中了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:51.20,0:26:53.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但其他飞船攻过来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:56.07,0:26:57.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会被攻击的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:57.54,0:26:58.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,赶快想办法呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:58.68,0:27:02.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你问我，我也...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:10.42,0:27:11.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好厉害呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:11.76,0:27:13.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但无止境啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:13.96,0:27:15.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被包围了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:25.50,0:27:26.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:30.41,0:27:32.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不能控制了吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:36.01,0:27:38.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会被那星星吸进去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:56.07,0:27:57.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是怎样了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:58.77,0:27:59.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:00.37,0:28:01.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里是哪里?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:01.20,0:28:02.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莫非是天国?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:02.77,0:28:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么可能...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:04.91,0:28:07.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,列车好像没问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:07.41,0:28:09.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,刚刚的骚动不知是什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:09.65,0:28:11.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:11.70,0:28:13.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 技安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:13.25,0:28:15.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:16.85,0:28:18.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,黑色影团在哪里?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:18.56,0:28:20.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不知消失到哪里了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:20.52,0:28:21.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真可惜
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:21.89,0:28:22.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,若打过来的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:22.73,0:28:24.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,正打算攻回去呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:24.80,0:28:27.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真没干劲的家伙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:27.33,0:28:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过还不能掉以轻心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:29.80,0:28:33.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们可能马上就攻过来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:33.07,0:28:34.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,胡说的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:34.87,0:28:37.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这到底是什么地方\N哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:37.44,0:28:39.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也不知道呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:39.34,0:28:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去车长那里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:40.28,0:28:44.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请求警备队支援
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:45.38,0:28:47.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,黑色影团又来了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:47.68,0:28:49.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不，这是烟火
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:49.79,0:28:50.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:52.86,0:28:54.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听得到音乐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:54.52,0:28:55.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:55.76,0:28:57.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看 影像越来越近了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:58.66,0:28:59.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各位
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:59.90,0:29:02.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各位欢迎光临
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:02.53,0:29:08.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里是宇宙中最大、最新\N最棒的梦幻乐园
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:08.57,0:29:10.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,梦幻乐园?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:10.44,0:29:11.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:11.48,0:29:14.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,曾听说银河外盖有一个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:14.41,0:29:16.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,主题乐园
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:16.45,0:29:18.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是这里啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:18.22,0:29:21.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,最开始的节目列车强盗秀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:21.42,0:29:23.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各位觉得好玩吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:23.42,0:29:24.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:24.72,0:29:26.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,刚刚的是秀啰?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:26.76,0:29:29.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎没察觉到呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:29.46,0:29:31.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我还以为死了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:31.16,0:29:33.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,梦幻乐园为附近的小学生们
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:33.93,0:29:36.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,准备有忍者星球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:36.37,0:29:38.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,西部星球及恐龙星球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:38.80,0:29:41.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各种的冒险游戏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:42.77,0:29:44.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,赶快去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:45.78,0:29:48.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来是列车的实况转播
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:48.91,0:29:50.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恐龙的星球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:51.08,0:29:52.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:52.25,0:29:53.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:56.15,0:29:58.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么多人呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:58.22,0:30:00.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听说有600人喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:00.96,0:30:01.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:01.73,0:30:02.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:02.59,0:30:05.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们的打扮很有趣耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:05.16,0:30:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很久以前的打扮呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:07.40,0:30:08.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是以前的人吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:10.77,0:30:11.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:11.80,0:30:13.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们是从20世纪来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:13.60,0:30:16.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊? 20世纪?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:16.04,0:30:18.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难怪穿着落伍
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:18.41,0:30:19.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:19.34,0:30:20.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是以前的人嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:20.24,0:30:21.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在电视上看过的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:21.81,0:30:23.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,20世纪的人是不是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:23.05,0:30:24.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,住在洞窟里呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:24.92,0:30:27.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用石头做的穴吧?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:27.28,0:30:30.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么会...\N铁之类的东西已经在用了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:30.55,0:30:33.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们这些家伙 欺负人呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:33.16,0:30:34.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,技安，别这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:34.42,0:30:36.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各位
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:36.39,0:30:40.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在要进入梦幻乐园
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:40.33,0:30:44.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请先回列车上 先回列车上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:13.13,0:31:14.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是那个星球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:14.40,0:31:17.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比小惑星里较高等的星球上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:17.67,0:31:20.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,突然有很多生命体闯进来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:20.70,0:31:22.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是什么集团呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:22.34,0:31:24.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有什么目的?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:24.54,0:31:27.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让间谍去查查看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:28.55,0:31:30.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请小心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:30.51,0:31:31.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:48.53,0:31:50.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,列车自动降落
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:50.63,0:31:52.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是方便呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:52.07,0:31:53.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,赶快走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:53.04,0:31:54.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去西部星球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:54.20,0:31:56.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,传说中的怪兽星球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:56.14,0:31:58.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有吸血鬼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:58.01,0:32:00.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个也蛮好玩的样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:00.28,0:32:00.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:00.88,0:32:02.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,先去西部星球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:02.61,0:32:03.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再去...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:03.38,0:32:04.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄，走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:04.88,0:32:07.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好！去西部星球吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:07.25,0:32:09.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说什么?去忍者星球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:09.82,0:32:11.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但西部星球...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:11.99,0:32:15.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫也想去忍者星球，对吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:15.93,0:32:16.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,忍者星球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:16.83,0:32:18.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看 二比一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:18.43,0:32:20.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就决定去忍者星球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:20.50,0:32:23.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那也要问一下静香呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:23.90,0:32:25.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,静香
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:25.27,0:32:26.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,咦，去哪里了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:26.80,0:32:28.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊！任意门
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:28.41,0:32:32.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,静香有重要的事先回去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:32.18,0:32:33.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:33.04,0:32:35.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自己喜欢去哪个星球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:35.18,0:32:36.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就去哪个星球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:36.01,0:32:37.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,坐小飞机的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:37.65,0:32:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就可以自由的去绕了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:39.48,0:32:41.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎不早说呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:41.99,0:32:43.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么，我...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:43.99,0:32:45.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们去忍者星球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:45.79,0:32:47.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:47.32,0:32:48.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们也走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:48.63,0:32:49.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:49.53,0:32:52.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,留个话给静香
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:52.63,0:32:55.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,技安和小夫去忍者星球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:55.50,0:32:58.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我和大雄去西部星球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:58.17,0:32:59.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,静香也赶快来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:59.57,0:33:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等你来哟
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:01.91,0:33:03.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:06.04,0:33:08.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去哪里借小飞机呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:08.11,0:33:11.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从这直走约2公里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:11.41,0:33:13.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么? 2公里?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:14.55,0:33:16.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真远啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:16.25,0:33:17.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真不方便
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:17.85,0:33:18.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂！古代人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:18.89,0:33:19.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们在做什么呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:19.96,0:33:21.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,加油呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:21.46,0:33:24.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不懂什么是轴承路啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:24.66,0:33:25.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊，对了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:25.40,0:33:27.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,轴承路
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:27.43,0:33:29.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么是轴承路?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:29.07,0:33:31.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看看路面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:31.40,0:33:34.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是用小圆球做的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:34.04,0:33:36.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要利用圆球上回转力的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:36.54,0:33:38.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,速度就会变得很快的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:38.37,0:33:40.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来如此
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:51.25,0:33:53.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,重量波推进飞机
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:53.36,0:33:54.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有各种式样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:54.79,0:33:56.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这架如何?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:56.43,0:33:58.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们也会操纵吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:58.73,0:34:01.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的 这是全自动的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:01.30,0:34:02.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以操纵没问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:02.23,0:34:04.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但请不要去“禁断星球”
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:04.67,0:34:05.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:05.80,0:34:08.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,导游手册也提到过
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:08.10,0:34:11.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么请慢慢享用
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:11.21,0:34:15.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,西部星球，出发
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:23.12,0:34:24.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,“禁断星球”是什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:24.89,0:34:28.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以前曾有人在那挖掘矿石
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:28.86,0:34:30.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在是无人星球\N到处都是坑洞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:30.66,0:34:33.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很危险的 现在禁止进入
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:47.01,0:34:49.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,欢迎光临枪烟城市
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:49.51,0:34:53.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是市长柯林顿.依斯.吴顿
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:53.05,0:34:56.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,马上，今天我们要从各位中选出
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:56.55,0:35:00.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,本市的警长
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:00.16,0:35:02.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在射击大会即将开始
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:02.63,0:35:04.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,将会选出警长的助手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:04.93,0:35:11.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,警长助手是最能够享有\N警长的各种名誉的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:13.07,0:35:14.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么各位请到饭店里换衣服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:14.80,0:35:19.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 然后到会场集合\N- 警长?我好想...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:19.08,0:35:19.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,射击的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:19.64,0:35:21.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是有自信的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:21.41,0:35:23.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,咦，古代人也来啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:23.75,0:35:25.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,弓箭应比手枪更适合吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:25.75,0:35:26.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别笑我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:26.85,0:35:28.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等着瞧吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:33.02,0:35:37.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如何?适合我吗?\N很有架势吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:37.13,0:35:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,像西部牛仔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:40.06,0:35:41.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,里头装有真的子弹?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:41.76,0:35:42.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:42.70,0:35:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这上面写的是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:43.97,0:35:45.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果打到坏角色的机器人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:45.80,0:35:47.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就会停在机器人身上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:47.17,0:35:48.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但打到人的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:48.91,0:35:49.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就会变得轻飘飘的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:49.94,0:35:50.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在空中浮上来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:50.94,0:35:52.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以是很安全的子弹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:53.64,0:35:54.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看着吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:54.51,0:35:56.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我将成为警长
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:57.58,0:36:00.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会场在这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:00.02,0:36:02.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,候选人请到这儿来集合
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:02.52,0:36:06.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,标的物是这六个空瓶及空罐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:06.22,0:36:08.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请听我的哨声后开始射击
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:08.12,0:36:11.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,6发里面 只要中2发就合格
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:11.59,0:36:13.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,第一位请就位
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:13.60,0:36:14.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:15.57,0:36:17.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像很强的样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:17.00,0:36:19.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看起来就像西部的男人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:19.90,0:36:21.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,准备好了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:21.34,0:36:23.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,随时奉陪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:29.68,0:36:32.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只中1发 不合格
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:32.85,0:36:34.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个中心没偏歪吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:34.52,0:36:36.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没这回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:36.42,0:36:37.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真奇怪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:37.72,0:36:39.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下一位
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:39.42,0:36:40.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太可惜了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:40.72,0:36:42.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,绝对是歪的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:44.99,0:36:46.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,中2发
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:46.20,0:36:47.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,合格
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:47.13,0:36:48.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下一位
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:48.20,0:36:49.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊，换我了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:49.37,0:36:50.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,加油
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:50.90,0:36:52.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要全都打中喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:55.51,0:36:58.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全部没打中 不合格 下一位
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:58.88,0:37:00.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看我的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:04.35,0:37:06.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你打到我了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:06.05,0:37:07.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不合格
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:07.12,0:37:08.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下一位
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:08.28,0:37:09.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,加油
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:09.85,0:37:11.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,交给我了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:11.55,0:37:12.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全看你的了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:17.69,0:37:18.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,中5发
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:18.70,0:37:20.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,目前的最高者
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:20.16,0:37:21.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,合格！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:21.13,0:37:22.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小意思嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:22.40,0:37:23.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:23.37,0:37:25.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定会是警长啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:25.77,0:37:26.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不及格
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:29.14,0:37:30.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,合格
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:31.91,0:37:33.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,中3发
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:33.11,0:37:33.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,合格
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:33.84,0:37:35.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下一位
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:35.78,0:37:37.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 轮到古代人了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:37.31,0:37:38.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家躲好喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:38.45,0:37:40.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,子弹会飞到哪里可不知道唷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:41.72,0:37:42.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,随你们笑吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:42.99,0:37:44.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然很难每个都中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:44.62,0:37:47.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是集中一个目标的话\N我可是很厉害的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:51.76,0:37:52.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只中1发
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:52.73,0:37:55.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不合格
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:55.23,0:37:58.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不合格 果然是古代人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:58.50,0:38:00.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请仔细看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:04.51,0:38:06.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,6个洞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:06.01,0:38:08.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,子弹在罐子里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:08.14,0:38:09.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,6发全中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:09.75,0:38:11.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,合格
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:11.81,0:38:12.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好厉害喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:12.78,0:38:14.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:16.69,0:38:20.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在举行各位警长助手的\N任命仪式
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:20.39,0:38:22.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请各位维持秩序
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:22.19,0:38:23.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和罪犯挑战
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:23.56,0:38:27.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让枪烟城市成为\N永远和平的城市
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:27.93,0:38:29.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:29.00,0:38:30.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,授予徽章
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:30.67,0:38:32.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(警长)
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:33.37,0:38:35.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄很适合你唷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:35.44,0:38:36.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦也是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:36.67,0:38:38.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好厉害呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:38.11,0:38:38.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:38.91,0:38:40.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会成为警长的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:43.45,0:38:44.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:44.51,0:38:46.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也好想当呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:46.22,0:38:46.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你等着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:46.55,0:38:46.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你等着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:46.98,0:38:49.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我一定会成为警长的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:50.55,0:38:52.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再来要做什么呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:52.72,0:38:57.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可能在哪里\N有人会发动暴动吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:58.19,0:39:01.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不得了，银行强盗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:01.66,0:39:03.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄看你的了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:03.60,0:39:04.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:10.07,0:39:12.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:12.31,0:39:12.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:12.91,0:39:14.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,与其开枪\N跟在后面追比较快
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:14.84,0:39:15.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:15.75,0:39:17.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦 竹蜻蜓
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:17.01,0:39:17.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:18.95,0:39:21.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不行 违反规则
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:21.72,0:39:23.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在西部星球里使用竹蜻蜓
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:23.75,0:39:27.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其他的客人会说话的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:27.12,0:39:29.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:29.03,0:39:30.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,闪开，别挡路
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:31.93,0:39:32.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,古代人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:32.86,0:39:34.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别在那里拖拖拉拉的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:35.43,0:39:36.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:36.10,0:39:37.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去“OK牧场”骑马
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:37.43,0:39:38.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:39.87,0:39:41.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然它是最乖巧的...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:41.27,0:39:46.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,适合我们的只有这匹了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:46.14,0:39:48.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真不好意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:48.24,0:39:49.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等我们赶到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:49.88,0:39:51.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,天都黑了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:51.81,0:39:53.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根据这张手册
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:53.25,0:39:56.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,西部有个叫“死亡山谷”里面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:56.02,0:39:57.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有强盗集团
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:58.00,0:40:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(死亡山谷)
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:08.83,0:40:10.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有人来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:10.57,0:40:11.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被打中了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:11.87,0:40:14.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对方有4个人\N只有我一人脱逃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:16.07,0:40:17.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你有没有关系呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:17.84,0:40:21.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一个钟头后就会落地
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:24.71,0:40:26.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家好像都被打中了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:26.32,0:40:28.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,古代人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:28.08,0:40:30.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在还没被打中前赶快走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:30.89,0:40:33.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄，敌人很接近唷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:33.19,0:40:34.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道，走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:37.13,0:40:37.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是那里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:40.03,0:40:42.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,悄悄地靠近查看情形
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:42.13,0:40:45.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这之前被发现就完了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:45.00,0:40:47.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,隐形液体
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:47.30,0:40:50.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把它倒到地面就可以钻进地下了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:50.17,0:40:52.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:54.31,0:40:57.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄，分两路进行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:57.05,0:40:57.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:02.95,0:41:04.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从窗户偷偷地看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:07.39,0:41:08.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 有人出来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:11.73,0:41:13.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有人会来了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:13.93,0:41:18.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是一群胆小鬼没骨气
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:18.33,0:41:20.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,咦?怎么会有帽子呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:20.80,0:41:22.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 大雄被发现了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:31.45,0:41:32.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:32.58,0:41:34.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,应该是狐狸吧?真稀奇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:34.98,0:41:37.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把他腌在罐里头吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:37.32,0:41:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看看有没有其他同党
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:38.82,0:41:40.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让他招供
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:40.46,0:41:41.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让我来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:41.89,0:41:42.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下 我在这
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:50.20,0:41:51.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,干掉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:53.30,0:41:59.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,任命大雄是我们城市的\N正义警长
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:59.84,0:42:02.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:02.31,0:42:03.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去别的星球吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:03.58,0:42:05.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:05.05,0:42:06.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去哪个星球呀?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:06.82,0:42:07.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这神气的模样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:07.72,0:42:09.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真想让静香看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:09.85,0:42:12.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有小夫跟技安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:12.36,0:42:15.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,忍者星球不知道好不好玩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:17.53,0:42:19.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这太难啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:19.43,0:42:22.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以不想来忍者星球嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:22.30,0:42:25.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啰唆，再说要掉下去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:26.37,0:42:28.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,技安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:32.00,0:42:34.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,眼睛看着路啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:34.34,0:42:36.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,修行还不够
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:36.68,0:42:39.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所谓忍者就是要对死亡觉悟
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:39.92,0:42:43.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有的苦都要忍受
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:43.69,0:42:45.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你教我们啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:45.39,0:42:46.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:46.99,0:42:48.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们希望能在空中飞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:48.72,0:42:52.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,或是学会隐身术等\N较特别的技术
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:52.50,0:42:54.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是这样的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:54.33,0:42:56.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不如在学校上体育课
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:56.57,0:43:00.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在的小孩真没耐性
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:00.37,0:43:02.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫，我们去别的星球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:02.77,0:43:04.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:04.07,0:43:05.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:05.74,0:43:06.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真拿你们没办法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:06.88,0:43:09.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只好传授你们临时证
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:09.21,0:43:11.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,传授临时证?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:11.85,0:43:15.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,传授你们这个临时证
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:15.85,0:43:18.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是为了让忍者修行成绩良好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:18.09,0:43:21.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,使用此卷轴能成穿墙隐形人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:21.86,0:43:24.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就用这个卷轴能成穿墙隐形人?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:24.26,0:43:26.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如何使用?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:26.23,0:43:30.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,里头有输入念力的电脑程式
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:30.27,0:43:31.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要含在嘴里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:31.17,0:43:32.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,心里想着 就可以穿墙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:32.84,0:43:36.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爬墙之术 隐身之术
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:36.21,0:43:38.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且能够变成老鼠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:38.81,0:43:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就这样而已?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:40.28,0:43:42.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,临时证就是这样而已啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:42.21,0:43:43.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫，试试看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:43.98,0:43:44.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:50.35,0:43:52.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,成功了，技安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:52.05,0:43:53.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:53.26,0:43:55.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么接受测验看看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:55.93,0:43:56.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,通过了的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:56.69,0:43:58.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能拿到真正的证明唷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:00.76,0:44:05.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,深入那座城去找秘密的文件
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:05.70,0:44:08.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,正式的证书可以用在\N很多的法术上吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:08.47,0:44:09.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那当然
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:09.37,0:44:11.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有的法术都输入在里头了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:11.34,0:44:12.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定要拿到
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:12.24,0:44:13.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫，走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:13.54,0:44:15.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,期待拿到忍者证书
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:22.22,0:44:23.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:23.39,0:44:25.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有守卫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:25.25,0:44:26.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那走这边
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:33.43,0:44:36.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用穿墙术就可轻松钻进来了\N我们走
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:41.40,0:44:44.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,秘密文件在哪里呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:46.38,0:44:47.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有可疑者
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:47.01,0:44:48.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抓起来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:48.84,0:44:50.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别逃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:50.65,0:44:52.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,变成老鼠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:52.62,0:44:53.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别逃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:58.85,0:45:00.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能用法术真好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:00.92,0:45:01.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:02.22,0:45:04.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊！有写着秘书之房
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:04.39,0:45:06.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,秘密文件应该藏在这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:07.83,0:45:09.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好大的房间呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:09.27,0:45:10.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,技安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:10.03,0:45:11.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那边放着一个什么东西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:11.60,0:45:12.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,咦?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:13.07,0:45:14.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:14.20,0:45:15.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,秘书之箱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:18.14,0:45:19.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:19.41,0:45:21.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么简单就拿到啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:25.11,0:45:26.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是新手吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:26.42,0:45:27.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没那么简单
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:27.92,0:45:30.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,10年后再来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:32.02,0:45:35.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈妈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:36.83,0:45:38.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,猜拳输了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:38.93,0:45:40.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没办法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:40.16,0:45:43.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,童话星球是少女喜欢的呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:43.47,0:45:45.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是女孩子嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:47.37,0:45:49.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,欢迎光临童话星球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:59.85,0:46:01.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇 你们看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:01.38,0:46:02.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这么大的彩虹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:02.82,0:46:04.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看到啦，真啰唆
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:07.09,0:46:08.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么东西飞过来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:08.39,0:46:09.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会不会是侯鸟呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:10.36,0:46:12.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,天马，是天马群
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:12.50,0:46:14.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不错耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:14.90,0:46:16.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:16.57,0:46:18.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好啦 快走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:18.23,0:46:19.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:19.80,0:46:22.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,办公室在那边
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:23.07,0:46:24.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在童话星球里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:24.47,0:46:27.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你将成为童话中的主角
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:27.04,0:46:32.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有各种不同的游戏\N让你亲身体验
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:32.65,0:46:34.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,例如灰姑娘、拇指姑娘
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:34.55,0:46:35.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:35.82,0:46:37.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要参加白雪公主
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:37.59,0:46:38.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:38.75,0:46:40.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,白雪公主是最受欢迎的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:40.56,0:46:41.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要排队等
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:41.76,0:46:42.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:42.66,0:46:43.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果是狐狸秀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:43.96,0:46:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,马上就可进场
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:45.53,0:46:47.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,才不要呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:47.63,0:46:50.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么请再等3次
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:50.23,0:46:51.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那边的两位客人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:51.53,0:46:53.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要不要当王子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:53.50,0:46:55.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:55.60,0:46:56.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:56.51,0:46:57.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让你们久等了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:57.91,0:47:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,先吃热狗吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:00.54,0:47:01.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:01.31,0:47:03.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,正在等待的客人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:03.58,0:47:04.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果觉得无聊的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:04.58,0:47:08.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以先到前面去见习 如何呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:17.33,0:47:20.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,童话故事的现场到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:20.83,0:47:22.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:22.90,0:47:25.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,玻璃棺木有7具啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:26.27,0:47:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为参加者太多了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:28.07,0:47:30.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以一次用7个白雪公主
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:30.64,0:47:32.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,同时进行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:32.41,0:47:34.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 王子来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:37.31,0:47:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,王子，请救救白雪公主
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:39.75,0:47:41.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,王子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:41.18,0:47:44.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么? 7个白雪公主
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:44.79,0:47:47.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,王子，伤脑筋呀...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:47.02,0:47:49.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇 好可爱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:52.66,0:47:53.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,公主
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:53.56,0:47:54.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,王子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:54.66,0:47:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我正在等着你呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:56.30,0:47:58.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去我城堡里好吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:58.43,0:47:59.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我愿意
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:00.40,0:48:02.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 我也等好久了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:02.94,0:48:04.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:04.61,0:48:06.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎能只选一个公主
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:06.98,0:48:09.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我等了5次了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:09.41,0:48:11.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,该怎么办呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:12.31,0:48:13.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样你也要参加吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:16.85,0:48:18.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,早就说过了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:18.39,0:48:20.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,童话星球是很无趣的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:20.72,0:48:22.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这次换我的了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:22.39,0:48:24.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去恐龙星球吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:24.66,0:48:27.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去和恐龙对决
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:27.73,0:48:30.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那边好像有个生命体
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:30.80,0:48:32.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,附到其中一个人身上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:32.77,0:48:34.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抓一个人来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:34.70,0:48:37.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,凭你也想当公主啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:42.28,0:48:45.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对吧 阿斯达
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:45.05,0:48:46.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么啦?阿斯达
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:46.10,0:48:47.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,突然间安静下来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:50.02,0:48:51.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿斯达你不要紧吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:51.95,0:48:53.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我的身体呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:53.29,0:48:57.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 好久没有进入新的生命体了\N- 阿斯达
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:02.02,0:49:04.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 你怎么了\N- 你搞什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:10.57,0:49:11.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,紧急联络
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:11.91,0:49:15.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,总司令部，我是008号
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:15.14,0:49:18.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我已进入人体里成功了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:19.55,0:49:23.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有 在小惑星里\N有好几百人蠢动着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:23.49,0:49:25.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,正等着你的指令
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:25.99,0:49:27.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里是总司令部
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:27.32,0:49:30.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,008号真厉害，辛苦了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:30.03,0:49:32.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接下来马上进行第2个动作
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:32.86,0:49:34.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,进入每一个人的身体里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:34.53,0:49:39.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去习惯人体 等待指令
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:39.87,0:49:42.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,准备好了后 发动总攻击
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:42.80,0:49:45.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后可以把整个星球占据下来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:51.48,0:49:55.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后被星球的武士抓走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:55.78,0:49:58.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把我们关在地下道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:58.05,0:49:59.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用穿墙术才好不容易
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:59.96,0:50:01.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,逃出来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:01.12,0:50:03.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,童话星球也是...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:03.36,0:50:06.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以如果去西部星球就好了呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:06.20,0:50:10.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明天一起去中世纪的星球吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:10.30,0:50:12.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恐龙星球啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:12.17,0:50:13.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:13.50,0:50:17.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是好可怕呀\N恐龙会攻击我们的耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:17.11,0:50:20.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没问题 是休闲乐园，很安全的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:20.84,0:50:24.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么为了明天 今晚要好好睡一觉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:32.09,0:50:39.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,华丽边际的星球\N是属于太阳系的小惑星
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:39.70,0:50:41.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由于地方不便
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:41.16,0:50:44.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以前出有矿石而曾轰动一时
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:44.73,0:50:48.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为有珍贵的矿石
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:48.94,0:50:52.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但矿石挖完后
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:52.24,0:50:56.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只剩下坑坑洞洞的小星球而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:56.85,0:50:58.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,失去工作的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:58.81,0:51:04.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,丢下田园到城市去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:04.29,0:51:05.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样下去的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:05.39,0:51:08.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些边际星球会消灭的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:08.86,0:51:12.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,梦幻乐园是我们\N讨论了好几次的结果
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:12.76,0:51:13.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来如此
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:13.70,0:51:17.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以才盖了梦幻乐园
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:17.37,0:51:18.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:18.20,0:51:20.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,边际星球所有人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:20.47,0:51:23.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对于残留的星球做的赌注
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:23.51,0:51:25.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果巴姆能把这里一流的器材
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:25.94,0:51:27.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以及漂亮的景色
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:27.61,0:51:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,登在新闻上 让大家知道的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:30.01,0:51:32.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的，等我取材后
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:32.82,0:51:34.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定会登在报纸上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:34.35,0:51:37.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,首先要确认的是安全性的问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:37.55,0:51:40.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很多乐园里\N有许多的机器坏掉的毛病
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:40.86,0:51:43.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,客人会发生危险的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:43.89,0:51:46.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是绝对不可能的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:46.03,0:51:48.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看那栋建筑物
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:48.23,0:51:49.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是控制中心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:49.93,0:51:52.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一天24小时都会
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:52.70,0:51:54.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,守着周围的星球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:54.80,0:51:57.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大如恐龙星球 小如妖精
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:57.54,0:52:00.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但万一发生事故时...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:00.68,0:52:02.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在那中心的后面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:02.44,0:52:07.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有个通信灯塔\N可以发出求救信号
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:07.35,0:52:12.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一有什么问题\N本部的警卫队就会马上赶来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:14.82,0:52:16.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么明天开始
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:16.53,0:52:19.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会去各地探访
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:19.23,0:52:21.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请慢慢探访
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:21.86,0:52:24.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我送你\N- 谢谢你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:25.33,0:52:26.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,麻烦你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:27.04,0:52:30.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊，好晚了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:30.07,0:52:32.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,咦?那些发光体是什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:32.71,0:52:34.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是流星吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:34.18,0:52:37.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这附近的天空有很多星屑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:41.78,0:52:43.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:43.02,0:52:45.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不客气，晚安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:45.15,0:52:45.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,晚安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:50.43,0:52:52.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家都看到了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:52.59,0:52:55.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,马上开始行动
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:55.26,0:52:57.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,个别去找一个人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:57.17,0:52:59.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把自己放进去习惯人体
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:59.33,0:53:00.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,目标是控制中心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:00.97,0:53:03.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,及通讯中心的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:03.14,0:53:06.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定要让机器人混乱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:09.04,0:53:10.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:10.75,0:53:12.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是去通信室的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:12.78,0:53:14.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,001号行动
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:30.70,0:53:31.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 怎么了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:31.70,0:53:32.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,发生什么事?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:32.87,0:53:35.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没什么，只是跌倒了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:35.80,0:53:37.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么交班了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:37.34,0:53:39.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果生病的话不要勉强唷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:39.17,0:53:40.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不用担心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:40.94,0:53:43.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么晚安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:45.41,0:53:48.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,身分确认
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:48.98,0:53:51.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,指纹确认
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:51.02,0:53:52.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,确认完毕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:53.49,0:53:54.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开门
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:56.43,0:53:58.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明天就破坏这里的设备
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:58.99,0:54:04.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,边际星球就没得救了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:04.07,0:54:06.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真简单
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:06.03,0:54:08.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 部长在叫我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:08.20,0:54:10.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有发光体掉落地面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:10.87,0:54:12.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请保安队调查
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:12.54,0:54:14.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是！马上联络
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:16.01,0:54:17.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,笨蛋人类
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:17.81,0:54:20.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,末日到了还不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:25.39,0:54:27.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦，起来了吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:27.42,0:54:28.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:30.00,0:54:31.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,起来了 早安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:31.76,0:54:32.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,早安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:32.76,0:54:35.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,静香，好早呀 现在马上准备
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:35.93,0:54:37.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这之前有事想麻烦你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:39.47,0:54:43.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊?要任意门\N做什么用?回家吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:43.41,0:54:45.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 洗澡\N- 啊?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:45.21,0:54:48.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,昨晚没法洗嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:48.11,0:54:52.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么呀，最里面的房间是浴室啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:52.81,0:54:55.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,早说嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:55.05,0:54:58.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哈哈哈，静香就是静香
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:59.29,0:55:02.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要出发可能还要一段时间
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:02.02,0:55:03.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,早安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:03.29,0:55:05.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,赶快去恐龙星球吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:05.33,0:55:06.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:06.70,0:55:07.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:07.63,0:55:10.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,出发前洗澡?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:11.50,0:55:13.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在星际中洗澡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:13.90,0:55:16.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真棒的露天澡啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:27.55,0:55:30.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊！真失礼！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:32.85,0:55:35.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是梦幻乐园的机器人?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:35.39,0:55:37.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,或是幽浮玩具?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:38.59,0:55:40.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是色狼幽浮呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:40.90,0:55:42.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,若说是玩具
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:42.13,0:55:43.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,做得很精致啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:43.43,0:55:45.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这种东西等一下再说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:45.63,0:55:46.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,赶快去玩吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:46.57,0:55:48.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:49.77,0:55:51.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,出发
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:53.51,0:55:54.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊 巴姆先生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:55.28,0:55:58.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,早安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:55:58.21,0:56:01.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要不要和我们一起去恐龙星球?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:01.52,0:56:02.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:02.85,0:56:05.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是不到各地探访是不行的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:05.52,0:56:07.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们慢慢玩吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:07.66,0:56:08.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真辛苦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:08.76,0:56:10.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们先走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:13.23,0:56:16.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天是大冒险的开始喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:25.95,0:56:27.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这中生代的星球里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:27.78,0:56:31.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,代表着三叠纪，侏罗纪及\N白亚纪时期的恐龙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:31.75,0:56:34.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,像古时候一样地生活着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:35.79,0:56:38.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各位请自由地探险
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:38.36,0:56:41.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,第一天靠近自己喜欢的恐龙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:41.09,0:56:43.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和他们培养感情成为朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:43.13,0:56:45.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以像好朋友般乘坐自如后
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:45.93,0:56:48.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,第二天便可参加赛龙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:48.74,0:56:51.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是说骑恐龙竞赛啰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:51.81,0:56:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从山脚到海边
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:54.31,0:56:58.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,冠军奖品是让你\N选择自己喜欢的恐龙带回家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:56:58.11,0:57:00.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要最大的恐龙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:00.65,0:57:02.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,技安 你要放哪里呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:02.38,0:57:03.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊！对喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:03.98,0:57:06.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请问 有暴龙吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:07.15,0:57:08.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当然有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:08.66,0:57:10.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会攻击我们吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:10.36,0:57:12.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那当然
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:12.96,0:57:15.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,难道会被吃掉?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:15.23,0:57:17.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对啊！会把你吃掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:17.23,0:57:19.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后会变成怎样呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:19.17,0:57:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在肚子里变成化石然后吐出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:22.60,0:57:24.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也就是说游戏结束
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:24.37,0:57:27.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是个问题啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:27.54,0:57:28.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请放心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:28.44,0:57:30.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接待员会将你们恢复原状的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:30.90,0:57:32.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:32.71,0:57:36.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管怎么说，还是小心点才好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:36.22,0:57:38.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这里可以用竹蜻蜓
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:38.75,0:57:41.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真想和可爱的恐龙成为朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:41.49,0:57:43.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要大的恐龙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:47.96,0:57:49.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根据这个导游装置
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:49.63,0:57:53.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这附近好像有剑龙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:53.27,0:57:54.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去看看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:57.07,0:57:59.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,应该是在这附近的呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:57:59.81,0:58:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:00.77,0:58:01.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:01.57,0:58:03.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 在哪里?\N- 哪里?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:05.67,0:58:07.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:03.18,0:58:04.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那里呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:10.72,0:58:13.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,静香，不要站在那里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:13.09,0:58:14.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来这边嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:14.52,0:58:16.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,剑龙是草食动物
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:16.26,0:58:18.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,摸他也没关系唷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:19.13,0:58:20.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不会咬人吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:20.26,0:58:22.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对！很乖的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:22.06,0:58:23.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这家伙不动耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:23.46,0:58:24.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是不是在睡觉呀?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:24.96,0:58:26.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我来试试看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:28.20,0:58:29.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别这样呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:33.77,0:58:36.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,剑龙不适合赛龙耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:36.21,0:58:37.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:37.88,0:58:40.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我还是找小只一点的比较好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:40.38,0:58:43.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我们各自去找自己喜欢的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:43.35,0:58:44.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就这么办吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:44.92,0:58:46.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也赞成
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:46.99,0:58:48.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么 如果有什么事情的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:48.49,0:58:51.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就用这个导游装置联络
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:51.19,0:58:52.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:52.23,0:58:53.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好，小夫 走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:58:53.99,0:58:56.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定要联络唷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:04.94,0:59:06.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像有什么要出现耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:15.62,0:59:19.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是迅猛龙 很凶暴的肉食恐龙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:19.42,0:59:21.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,长的不是很高大嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:21.35,0:59:24.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是头脑相当好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:24.99,0:59:28.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比如说，利用其中一只恐龙\N去分散目标物的注意力后
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:28.66,0:59:31.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其他的恐龙\N再悄悄的从后方攻击
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:37.70,0:59:39.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好危险啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:45.14,0:59:46.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是三犄龙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:46.98,0:59:49.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然可爱但是跑不快啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:49.98,0:59:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,肚子不饿吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:51.99,0:59:53.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,先填饱肚子再找吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:53.59,0:59:54.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:56.06,0:59:58.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快饱糖
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:58.42,0:59:59.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有香肠口味，真好吃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:59:59.96,1:00:03.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊 只要吃一粒就觉得很饱了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:03.13,1:00:06.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果有技安喜欢的暴龙就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:10.24,1:00:13.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么? 是小恐龙耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:17.01,1:00:20.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是只黏人的恐龙
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:20.15,1:00:23.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不行！这不能吃的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:23.32,1:00:25.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不行！我讨厌瘦小的恐龙
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:25.79,1:00:27.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我喜欢大恐龙
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:33.63,1:00:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,技安，你看这个脚印
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:35.90,1:00:38.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哇！这可是大恐龙唷
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:38.10,1:00:39.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会在哪里呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:39.63,1:00:42.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,技安，在这里，在这！
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:45.07,1:00:46.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好大啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:46.54,1:00:48.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是脕龙
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:56.45,1:00:58.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就是在找这么大的恐龙
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:00:58.89,1:01:01.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这才适合我呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:01.49,1:01:04.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大并不表示跑的快唷
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:04.29,1:01:05.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:05.79,1:01:08.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和蚂蚁，狗啦 比起来的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:08.13,1:01:09.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谁会赢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:09.23,1:01:11.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然这样 但要怎么坐上去呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:14.47,1:01:17.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起 我要去找别的恐龙
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:19.07,1:01:21.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有什么好办法呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:21.17,1:01:22.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真不想放弃呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:25.55,1:01:27.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊！想到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:27.61,1:01:28.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫，等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:28.58,1:01:29.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,干嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:29.75,1:01:31.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你来当我的助手
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:31.52,1:01:32.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:32.82,1:01:36.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看 为何它的脖子\N转向是那样的呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:36.52,1:01:38.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是他的事呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:38.52,1:01:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是他的事呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:39.43,1:01:41.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这你就不知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:41.16,1:01:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为他只吃嫩叶的关系
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:44.90,1:01:46.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那又怎样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:46.07,1:01:48.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以赶快去帮我找绿叶嫩芽
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:48.70,1:01:49.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:52.87,1:01:55.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是的，只顾到自己
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:55.71,1:01:57.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,多找一点啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:01:57.94,1:02:01.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,收集好了就拿到脕龙嘴边
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:01.58,1:02:03.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当作诱饵吸引他
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:09.62,1:02:11.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很好
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:13.09,1:02:15.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再跑快一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:15.19,1:02:17.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也想骑恐龙啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:17.80,1:02:21.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:21.07,1:02:23.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就像这样继续走
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:23.94,1:02:26.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你有点分寸吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:30.44,1:02:32.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不知道大家有没有\N找到自己喜欢的恐龙
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:32.68,1:02:34.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊！好可爱
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:35.55,1:02:37.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你也想吃是吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:40.62,1:02:43.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吃吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:43.16,1:02:46.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不能骑\N我只好找其他的恐龙了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:46.63,1:02:47.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:51.20,1:02:53.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟着来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:53.63,1:02:55.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但吃太多是不好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:02:56.84,1:03:02.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊！有大恐龙
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:02.04,1:03:04.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会不会是坏恐龙?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:04.51,1:03:07.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这种是鸭嘴龙\N奔跑的速度相当快
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:07.15,1:03:10.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但个性很温和
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:10.48,1:03:11.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,应该可以成为好朋友吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:11.88,1:03:13.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来，大家吃吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:25.33,1:03:27.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找不到喜欢的恐龙耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:27.97,1:03:30.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不知道他们找到喜欢的恐龙了没
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:33.84,1:03:36.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦！翼龙如何呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:36.71,1:03:38.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不错耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:38.68,1:03:41.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果是在空中飞的话\N一定是最快的了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:41.28,1:03:42.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好，去试试看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:44.79,1:03:45.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:50.39,1:03:53.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看，海上有好多喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:53.16,1:03:54.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,正在抓鱼呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:54.86,1:03:56.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是，要怎么坐上去呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:03:56.83,1:03:58.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,总之，先试试看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:05.97,1:04:07.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,成功了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:08.34,1:04:10.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:11.54,1:04:13.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很过瘾耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:13.38,1:04:14.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好，我也来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:14.85,1:04:15.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好，我也来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:18.55,1:04:22.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄，如果是翼龙的话\N一定会拿第一名唷
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:25.53,1:04:27.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你够了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:27.99,1:04:31.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很好，继续加油
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:31.33,1:04:35.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,换你来让他追追看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:35.03,1:04:37.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们会是第一名的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:37.77,1:04:40.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太难了 这是不可能的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:42.98,1:04:45.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:48.11,1:04:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫，让他停下来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:52.49,1:04:54.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:54.22,1:04:54.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,技安
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:04:55.69,1:04:58.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自己跑掉了 怎么了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:04.50,1:05:06.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是暴龙
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:10.14,1:05:11.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,往这里来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:11.74,1:05:13.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么办
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:19.08,1:05:21.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太重了 飞不起来，放开我
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:21.48,1:05:24.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你想丢下我吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:24.08,1:05:25.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊！竹蜻蜓...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:27.02,1:05:30.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,技安
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:30.26,1:05:33.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,妈妈 妈妈
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:44.34,1:05:45.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,咦！怎么了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:45.71,1:05:47.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,停下来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:49.04,1:05:51.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄，变熟练了喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:51.21,1:05:54.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,向左拉就会往左飞唷
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:05:54.38,1:05:55.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦，你看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:01.25,1:06:02.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:05.32,1:06:06.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:06.36,1:06:08.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都掉下来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:10.10,1:06:13.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到底发生什么事情?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:13.63,1:06:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是不是机器坏掉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:18.30,1:06:19.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是谁呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:20.41,1:06:21.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:21.21,1:06:26.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我！暴龙不动了\N到底怎么了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:26.15,1:06:28.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是因为这样才得救了呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:28.65,1:06:31.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说的也是，不过...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:31.92,1:06:34.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,静香不知怎么样了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:34.02,1:06:36.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好，联络看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:36.16,1:06:38.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,鸭嘴龙突然都倒下来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:38.39,1:06:40.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,发生什么事情了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:40.26,1:06:41.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你那里也一样?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:41.53,1:06:44.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个梦幻乐园的设计真糟糕呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:44.83,1:06:46.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去问问看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:46.87,1:06:49.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家到中央办公室集合吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:53.11,1:06:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:06:54.31,1:07:00.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,机器人都是由控制中心操纵的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:00.28,1:07:03.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么请赶快联络把他们修好
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:03.62,1:07:08.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其实我们刚刚\N已经向通讯塔联络了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:08.49,1:07:11.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是一点回应都没有...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:11.59,1:07:13.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里是中生代星球
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:13.19,1:07:17.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,控制中心，听到请回答
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:20.80,1:07:22.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,外面骚动起来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:28.04,1:07:30.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊！这是怎么回事?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:30.31,1:07:32.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有的机器人\N乱七八糟地动了起来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:42.99,1:07:44.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会变成怎样呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:44.26,1:07:46.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可能是中央星球发生什么事了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:46.83,1:07:48.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去看看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:48.46,1:07:52.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,控制中心，控制中心\N听到请回答
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:07:56.50,1:07:58.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家看那里
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:04.31,1:08:06.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,翼龙群攻过来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:06.41,1:08:07.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,赶快坐上去
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:16.46,1:08:18.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,加速
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:18.22,1:08:20.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,冲出这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:20.06,1:08:22.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,应该不会追到宇宙空间来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:22.46,1:08:25.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好，加速了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:25.13,1:08:26.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像快撞到了喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:26.43,1:08:28.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的吗?全速前进
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:34.27,1:08:35.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像甩掉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:43.92,1:08:45.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就是中央星球
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:45.55,1:08:47.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在好像是晚上
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:50.29,1:08:51.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们看那里
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:08:51.76,1:08:53.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是不是火灾呀?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:03.50,1:09:07.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,中央星球果真发生事情了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:07.37,1:09:08.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点去看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:21.09,1:09:23.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,分头去查查看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:23.32,1:09:26.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 我和小夫去有烟的地方看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:30.20,1:09:33.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有事的话 用导游装置联络吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:33.20,1:09:35.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道了，小夫走吧 好
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:35.17,1:09:36.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小心一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:36.77,1:09:37.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小心一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:37.34,1:09:39.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这应该是通讯塔吧?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:48.15,1:09:51.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你好，有人在吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:51.32,1:09:54.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,糟糕！被破坏得乱七八糟
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:54.39,1:09:56.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,火势变大了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:56.12,1:09:58.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不赶快逃走的话很危险的 技安
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:09:58.49,1:10:04.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 有人在吗\N- 没有人的 技安
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:04.50,1:10:09.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,技安 没人在的话 闯进来不好
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:09.47,1:10:10.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要先走噜
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:12.37,1:10:14.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是谁在那里?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:18.04,1:10:19.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有人在吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:21.08,1:10:24.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫！怎么了?小夫
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:24.58,1:10:28.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你在哪啊?小夫
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:28.92,1:10:30.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么自己跑走了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:30.86,1:10:34.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:35.06,1:10:37.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,屋顶找过了 都没有人在
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:37.93,1:10:40.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,翼楼也没人
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:40.67,1:10:43.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,地下室连一只蟑螂也没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:43.17,1:10:44.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到底是怎样了呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:44.80,1:10:47.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家都躲到哪里去了呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:49.98,1:10:51.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,技安，怎么了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:51.88,1:10:54.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫不见了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:55.68,1:10:57.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫不见了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:10:57.38,1:11:00.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,技安，在那边等着
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:00.02,1:11:02.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是的，让人操心的小夫
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:03.86,1:11:05.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要突然停下来嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:05.46,1:11:08.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘘，有人来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:08.23,1:11:09.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,躲起来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:10.66,1:11:12.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从游乐园里出来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:20.14,1:11:21.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:24.01,1:11:25.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是游乐园的设施
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:41.29,1:11:42.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在到处乱晃着呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:42.86,1:11:45.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们看天空
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:49.97,1:11:51.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有好多妖魔鬼怪呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:51.80,1:11:56.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,童话星球中的机器人来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:56.01,1:11:58.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到底怎么了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:11:58.08,1:12:00.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管了，快去技安那里
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:06.39,1:12:08.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄，这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:08.52,1:12:09.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,技安
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:10.39,1:12:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有没有小夫的消息?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:12.19,1:12:14.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没有 到底跑到哪里去了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:14.79,1:12:17.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莫非被妖怪拐走了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:17.96,1:12:19.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:22.37,1:12:23.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:23.14,1:12:25.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,技安，怎么了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:25.10,1:12:29.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你这家伙，突然就消失了\N真让人操心
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:29.17,1:12:30.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:30.48,1:12:32.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你现在在哪里
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:32.58,1:12:35.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我发现一个\N绝对安全可以隐藏的地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:35.41,1:12:37.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家赶快来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:37.45,1:12:39.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道了 在哪里呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:39.99,1:12:42.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那里好像没有妖怪
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:42.49,1:12:45.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来如此\N躲到那里就不会被发现了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:45.62,1:12:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,停！
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:02.94,1:13:04.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在那，在那
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:04.61,1:13:06.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫，你没事吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:07.28,1:13:09.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找你找好久啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:10.05,1:13:11.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家到齐啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:11.82,1:13:13.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了！发射
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:16.56,1:13:18.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你做什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:18.19,1:13:21.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要担心\N只是让你们睡一下而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:21.46,1:13:24.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,0009号，做得很好
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:24.70,1:13:27.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟其他人一样关到小屋去
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:27.90,1:13:30.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再来就算有几百人也是不够的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:30.90,1:13:34.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有800万只寄生虫在指令中心
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:37.21,1:13:43.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,马上天兵也要来征服新银河了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:44.18,1:13:46.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没水了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:46.35,1:13:48.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,早就喝完了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:48.32,1:13:50.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,食物也没有了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:50.36,1:13:52.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不知有没有人会来救我们
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:52.86,1:13:55.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么会有人来呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:55.56,1:13:57.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都是阿斯达
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:57.13,1:14:00.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有个有钱的老爸就这么自傲
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:00.97,1:14:02.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真讨厌
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:02.77,1:14:06.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对啊\N下次碰到的话要狠狠的咬他
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:06.47,1:14:10.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看！那不会是宇宙船吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:10.91,1:14:11.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:18.05,1:14:19.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:19.72,1:14:21.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,救救我们
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:38.70,1:14:42.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫 居然把我们关在这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:42.11,1:14:44.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放我们出去 放我们出去
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:44.51,1:14:47.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啰嗦！安静一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:47.05,1:14:50.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这家伙，你是小夫耶\N居然靠到敌方去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:50.85,1:14:55.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么小夫?我是寄生虫0009号
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:55.42,1:14:57.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他说是寄居蟹耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:57.29,1:14:58.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,寄居蟹?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:58.42,1:15:00.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是寄生虫
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:00.63,1:15:02.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是宇宙里最高级存在者
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:02.79,1:15:03.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们等着吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:03.96,1:15:08.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不久以后你们也会被寄身的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:08.50,1:15:11.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他说会被寄身的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:11.24,1:15:13.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是寄生生物吧?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:13.17,1:15:14.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,寄生生物?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:14.91,1:15:18.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自己没有身体只有脑部
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:18.68,1:15:21.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以寄生到其他动物身上
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:21.15,1:15:23.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,任意操纵
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:23.42,1:15:24.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像操纵木偶一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:24.92,1:15:27.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开什么玩笑 怎能被他们操纵
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:27.85,1:15:30.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是银河系的危机呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:30.12,1:15:34.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦\N赶紧用任意门联络警卫队
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:34.03,1:15:35.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对呀，没错
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:38.56,1:15:40.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦，振作一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:40.17,1:15:42.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,超空间被封锁住了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:42.77,1:15:45.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那四次元口袋也不能用啰?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:45.54,1:15:47.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:48.81,1:15:51.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊！你...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:51.11,1:15:54.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起，让你睡一下了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:54.45,1:15:57.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,警觉到的时候已经太晚了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:57.75,1:16:00.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,周围都是寄生人及妖怪
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:00.72,1:16:02.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,若不是遇到车长
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:02.96,1:16:05.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也会变成寄生人了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:05.32,1:16:07.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这次似乎事态严重了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:07.56,1:16:10.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦，没办法逃出去吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:10.56,1:16:12.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有一个好方法
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:13.80,1:16:16.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但不知道行不行得通
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:16.74,1:16:18.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,试试看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:23.31,1:16:24.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里是巡逻员
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:24.74,1:16:26.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像有大火灾
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:29.51,1:16:33.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,火灾到处都有，不管它们
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:33.35,1:16:37.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,反正有人类的地方都要破坏掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:37.12,1:16:41.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但要看好，别让他们逃掉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:41.26,1:16:42.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:55.37,1:16:57.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,加速前进
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:00.05,1:17:02.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,成功了耶！车长
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:02.01,1:17:05.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为动用了所有的发烟筒
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:05.62,1:17:07.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像火灾一样耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:07.92,1:17:10.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,连妖怪都被骗了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:10.89,1:17:12.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:28.24,1:17:30.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,逃走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:30.04,1:17:34.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,600多人跟列车全部都被跑掉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:34.58,1:17:36.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们的身体要如何解决呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:36.75,1:17:38.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,0008号
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:38.25,1:17:41.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果让警卫队知道\N征服新银河计划的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:41.35,1:17:43.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,该怎么办?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:43.22,1:17:47.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,敬爱的天兵，请别担心
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:47.16,1:17:50.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,列车的燃料都放掉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:50.36,1:17:53.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那又怎样了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:53.07,1:17:55.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以跑不远的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:55.60,1:18:01.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且他们一定会降落在\N附近小行星群里的某处
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:01.71,1:18:06.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么，赶快去找\N一定要将那600人得到手
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:21.09,1:18:22.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:22.59,1:18:24.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,房间是颠倒的耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:24.13,1:18:25.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么时候变成这样的?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:25.50,1:18:27.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我完全睡着了呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:27.33,1:18:29.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都是我的责任
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:29.84,1:18:32.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,完全没有燃料的关系
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:32.14,1:18:35.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,整个列车掉到惑星里了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:35.41,1:18:37.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这不是车长的责任
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:37.71,1:18:40.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也就是说掉到某个星球了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:40.51,1:18:41.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像是这样耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:41.75,1:18:45.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么可以对寄生虫这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:45.95,1:18:50.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起 等你恢复成原来的小夫时\N才能让你出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:50.12,1:18:51.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再忍耐一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:51.82,1:18:53.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家都在这里啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:53.89,1:18:55.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,竹蜻蜓收集来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:55.79,1:18:59.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其他客人都没事 只是都睡着了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:59.46,1:19:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,暂时不会醒来的样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:00.90,1:19:03.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去外面看看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:04.30,1:19:06.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊！怎么变这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:09.67,1:19:12.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这太严重了 乱七八糟的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:12.21,1:19:13.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还好我们没怎样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:13.58,1:19:16.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是因为这些灰的关系
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:16.25,1:19:17.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这座山是灰烬吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:17.98,1:19:22.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对！将矿石挖走后\N就剩这些灰烬了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:22.65,1:19:25.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也就是说 这里是“禁断星球”?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:25.32,1:19:26.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:30.66,1:19:32.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,车头若没摔坏的话就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:32.80,1:19:34.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没办法修吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:34.63,1:19:35.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太难了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:36.07,1:19:38.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那逃出来也没用了呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:38.97,1:19:40.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就这样像这个星球一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:40.64,1:19:42.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,饿死在这里吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:42.71,1:19:46.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,暂时可不必担心这些
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:46.48,1:19:47.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请跟我来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:48.81,1:19:51.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那里有岩石的地方\N是这星球的城市
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:53.92,1:19:56.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在没有人住在那里
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:56.22,1:20:00.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但仓库里应该藏有\N食物及水等东西
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:00.13,1:20:01.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去看看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:01.66,1:20:03.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对啊！赶紧去看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:04.63,1:20:07.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是那个，那个就是仓库
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:08.20,1:20:10.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊！好棒呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:10.00,1:20:11.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么都有耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:11.34,1:20:13.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就好像是便利商店一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:13.74,1:20:16.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,热腾腾的汉堡耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:16.54,1:20:18.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,义大利面
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:18.74,1:20:21.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有各种甜点呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:21.81,1:20:24.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不可能有铜锣烧吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:24.82,1:20:26.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要吃了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:26.45,1:20:28.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,尽量多吃一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:28.42,1:20:29.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吃
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:29.42,1:20:33.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真好吃
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:33.06,1:20:34.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,车长
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:34.26,1:20:35.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:36.50,1:20:38.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,办公室里发现这个东西
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:38.96,1:20:42.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这应该是地底1000公尺\N的矿坑图吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:42.97,1:20:44.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,果然没错
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:44.70,1:20:51.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那么这一个是运送\N矿石出去的矿坑内车站吧?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:51.11,1:20:52.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,猜对了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:52.81,1:20:55.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那车头应该还留着吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:55.58,1:20:57.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我还要再吃
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:57.92,1:21:00.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然有车头
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:00.42,1:21:04.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是所有的出口都被堵住了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:04.52,1:21:06.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太可惜了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:06.26,1:21:09.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想有车头的话\N就可以逃出去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:09.39,1:21:10.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不行的呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:10.76,1:21:12.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,矿坑里都塌陷了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:12.73,1:21:15.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,进去的话就出不来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:15.20,1:21:16.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:16.27,1:21:18.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,绝对不要进去
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:18.14,1:21:19.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道了，知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:21.87,1:21:23.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来讨论作战计划吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:26.91,1:21:30.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里有车头啊 太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:31.68,1:21:33.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,出口虽被堵住了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:33.02,1:21:34.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是有好多洞口
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:34.55,1:21:37.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以想办法绕远路出来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:37.76,1:21:40.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要有地图 就不可能迷路啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:40.59,1:21:43.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开始探险
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:44.59,1:21:49.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是技安，我是孩子王
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:50.40,1:21:53.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊！竟然把小夫给忘了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:53.07,1:21:55.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,寄生虫肚子也会饿吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:55.21,1:21:57.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为是人类的身体嘛...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:57.81,1:21:59.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,带点东西给他吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:01.98,1:22:03.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是有点不甘心
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:05.92,1:22:08.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,测到重力乱波了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:08.22,1:22:11.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定是人类跟列车的讯号
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:11.79,1:22:13.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全速追踪
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:19.06,1:22:21.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小心你们的脚步
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:23.13,1:22:24.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有没有关系?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:24.40,1:22:25.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:25.84,1:22:29.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊！这是上次洗澡时发现的幽浮
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:29.37,1:22:31.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,应该只是个玩具吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:31.71,1:22:33.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会是玩具吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:33.35,1:22:35.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像和寄生虫有关系呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:38.25,1:22:41.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拿给巴姆看看
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:41.12,1:22:43.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫，食物拿来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:43.56,1:22:46.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,打开门噜 小心一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:48.13,1:22:49.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫，怎么了?小夫...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:52.66,1:22:53.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:57.17,1:22:59.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我换身体可是轻而易举的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:03.84,1:23:06.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,转过这里就是第3区了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:06.28,1:23:08.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,应该有车头的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:08.05,1:23:11.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊！不行 都被落石挡住了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:11.68,1:23:16.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里不行的话 只好退到7区了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:18.22,1:23:20.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又有坍塌
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:20.46,1:23:22.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没关系，还有其他的路
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:22.80,1:23:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是技安...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:25.80,1:23:28.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用喷枪喷过后就掉下来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:28.00,1:23:29.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喷枪?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:29.13,1:23:31.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对，放在浴室的喷枪
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:31.64,1:23:33.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,咦！有声音
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:34.94,1:23:35.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:38.51,1:23:40.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是寄生虫的原形呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:40.91,1:23:42.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是不是这个喷枪?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:43.45,1:23:45.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对！就是这个
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:45.12,1:23:46.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是真空肥皂
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:46.92,1:23:50.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也就是全身被肥皂包围起来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:50.36,1:23:53.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以变硬了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:53.53,1:23:56.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,巴姆先生...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:56.00,1:23:57.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请过来一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:57.40,1:23:59.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄，怎么了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:00.00,1:24:01.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:05.24,1:24:06.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:11.34,1:24:13.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄，振作点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:14.71,1:24:17.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么?我攻击巴姆?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:17.88,1:24:20.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为你被寄生虫寄生了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:20.12,1:24:22.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但也因此找出弱点了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:23.96,1:24:26.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小夫恢复了喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:26.16,1:24:27.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:27.29,1:24:29.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我全都听哆啦A梦说了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:29.93,1:24:32.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我对大家做了不该做的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:32.26,1:24:34.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别放在心上，都是寄生虫害的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:34.83,1:24:37.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样同伴们都到齐了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:37.27,1:24:38.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,技安呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:39.60,1:24:43.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对啊！技安呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:43.34,1:24:45.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是哪里啊?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:45.21,1:24:49.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我迷路 搞不清楚方向了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:53.51,1:24:54.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有声音
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:58.72,1:25:00.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是谁来救我们的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:00.86,1:25:03.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是来救我的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:03.46,1:25:06.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 太好了\N- 太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:07.40,1:25:11.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,搞什么嘛！我们都迷了路
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:11.84,1:25:12.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真失望
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:12.97,1:25:16.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们从宇宙掉到这个洞里来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:16.31,1:25:19.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我为了进来找车头的 但迷路了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:19.81,1:25:23.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,车头?在那边有一辆啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:23.15,1:25:24.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:24.98,1:25:27.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的是车头耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:27.42,1:25:31.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有车头的话 就能逃出禁断星球了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:31.09,1:25:32.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们有救了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:34.83,1:25:39.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是，没有出口要怎样搬出去呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:39.06,1:25:44.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊！真的是\N不能和命运之神作战呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:44.64,1:25:47.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,至少也要记得把食物带进来的呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:47.81,1:25:50.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊！这是什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:54.51,1:26:00.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,技安...你在哪里?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:00.65,1:26:03.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,列车里都找遍了 但没看到人
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:03.35,1:26:05.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,路上也找过了 找不到
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:05.39,1:26:07.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去哪里了呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:07.69,1:26:11.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,发现技安的脚印了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:11.60,1:26:14.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,糟糕，跑到矿坑里去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:14.03,1:26:17.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 真是的\N- 不行！不能进去呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:17.00,1:26:19.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但不能坐视不管呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:19.34,1:26:23.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 技安\N- 技安...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:24.61,1:26:26.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,危险！坍塌了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:35.79,1:26:37.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,技安
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:39.49,1:26:42.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 技安\N- 技安
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:42.86,1:26:44.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不行！只好放弃了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:44.93,1:26:46.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,技安，好可怜呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:46.97,1:26:49.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然很粗暴，但也很体贴啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:49.53,1:26:51.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再也见不到他了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:02.61,1:27:04.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,忍法 穿墙术
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:04.72,1:27:06.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,技安
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:06.52,1:27:07.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好厉害呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:07.39,1:27:08.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有救了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:08.55,1:27:10.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,成功了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:17.80,1:27:19.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,水和食物都装上了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:19.33,1:27:21.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果有武器就更好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:21.80,1:27:23.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然没有武器
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:23.64,1:27:27.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是只要一天\N就可能到警卫队的星球
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:27.41,1:27:28.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以不用担心
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:41.42,1:27:43.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接收到强烈的重力波
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:43.86,1:27:45.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雷达也有列车影子的反应
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:45.99,1:27:48.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,敌人就在前面了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:48.19,1:27:52.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 全力转舵\N- 收到！全力转舵
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:52.66,1:27:56.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这次一定要全抓起来 让你瞧瞧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:56.37,1:27:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看你的表现了喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:58.24,1:28:01.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,发现列车了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:01.24,1:28:03.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,终究还是出现了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:03.04,1:28:04.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比想像中还要早嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:04.44,1:28:05.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然很不甘心
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:05.24,1:28:07.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但这种速度马上就会被追上的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:07.51,1:28:08.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们没有武器
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:08.91,1:28:10.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以能逃多远就逃多远
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:10.45,1:28:13.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,进入星屑的密集区吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:13.25,1:28:16.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,否则无法躲避那么大的宇宙船啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:16.52,1:28:18.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这意见不错
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:18.29,1:28:20.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,列车驾驶由我负责
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:20.36,1:28:21.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,麻烦你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:21.36,1:28:23.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,敌人都聚集了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:23.19,1:28:26.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,减速，收帆
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:26.26,1:28:27.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不用减速
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:27.93,1:28:32.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在进入密集区前让它们无法航行
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:32.17,1:28:34.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,攻击开始
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:43.01,1:28:45.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要攻击列车
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:45.28,1:28:47.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们需要人类的身体
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:50.12,1:28:54.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,列车失控了\N即将降落到那个星球上
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:09.04,1:29:12.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有人类都出来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:12.14,1:29:14.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们的身体是很珍贵的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:14.18,1:29:15.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们不会做坏的用途的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:19.85,1:29:21.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么这么安静?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:21.72,1:29:23.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,完全没有任何反应
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:37.70,1:29:39.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,站住！寄生虫们
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:39.90,1:29:40.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在等我们嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:40.94,1:29:42.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看枪
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:48.08,1:29:51.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿斯达
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:52.62,1:29:54.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿斯达，有没有关系?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:54.32,1:29:57.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,咦?这是哪里?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:57.16,1:29:58.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我怎么了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:58.82,1:30:00.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿斯达
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:00.56,1:30:02.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真爽快呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:02.46,1:30:03.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:05.06,1:30:06.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,彻退
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:07.20,1:30:09.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个金黄色的是老大
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:09.43,1:30:11.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要被逃掉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:12.64,1:30:14.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎能输给人类
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:18.61,1:30:18.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,躲到海贼船里了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:18.88,1:30:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,躲到海贼船里了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:22.98,1:30:26.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让你们瞧瞧寄生天兵的威力
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:26.58,1:30:31.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,寄生到机器人体内了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:31.49,1:30:34.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,寄生虫虽无法像生物般的活动
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:34.66,1:30:37.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是能操作电脑
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:37.56,1:30:39.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一起喷水
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:44.57,1:30:45.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊！不行呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:45.44,1:30:47.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,肥皂液无法喷到它
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:49.91,1:30:51.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,先找地方躲起来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:53.28,1:30:55.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,愚蠢的人类
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:55.21,1:30:56.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自认为逃得过吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:00.42,1:31:02.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那里有一个
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:04.46,1:31:06.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,吓到了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:06.29,1:31:11.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对了 寄生到你身上看看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:11.36,1:31:12.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:32.16,1:31:35.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,遗憾啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:41.26,1:31:43.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大雄，好厉害呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:49.67,1:31:51.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还是大雄厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:51.94,1:31:53.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是射击神枪手耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:53.27,1:31:55.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不好意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:55.24,1:31:57.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊！寄生虫被逃掉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:16.56,1:32:20.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真抱歉增加各位的麻烦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:20.36,1:32:23.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也谢谢帮我们解决问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:23.80,1:32:27.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那些寄生虫不可能再来侵犯了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:27.27,1:32:31.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了能早日重建这个乐园
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:31.84,1:32:33.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们会加油的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:33.28,1:32:35.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请加油
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:35.18,1:32:38.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们也会尽力协助的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:38.12,1:32:40.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢各位
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:40.32,1:32:43.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,车长，请将他们安全送回
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:43.96,1:32:45.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:53.03,1:32:57.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一路小心，再见
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:01.91,1:33:05.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再见
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:12.68,1:33:15.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽是大冒险 但是很有趣耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:15.15,1:33:19.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其他的人也恢复了原状 太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:19.79,1:33:24.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿斯达的爸爸\N也答应好要重建乐园
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:24.43,1:33:25.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:25.53,1:33:28.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也有责任的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:28.10,1:33:29.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是你的责任
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:29.70,1:33:31.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是寄生虫的责任
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:31.54,1:33:33.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对啊！是寄居蟹的错
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:33.57,1:33:35.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,技安，是寄生虫啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:35.64,1:33:36.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:39.51,1:33:41.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,曾经取笑你们是古代人
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:41.51,1:33:42.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:42.48,1:33:44.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真该学学各位的勇气
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:44.62,1:33:47.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各位 他们是从20世纪星球来的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:47.85,1:33:50.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我们的祖先唷
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:50.66,1:33:56.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就是祖父的祖父的\N祖父的祖父...
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:56.33,1:33:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是这种祖父呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:00.00,1:34:05.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,马上就要着陆在\N20世纪太阳系第3惑星
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:05.00,1:34:06.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:06.74,1:34:08.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还要再来喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:08.27,1:34:10.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那当然
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:14.61,1:34:18.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,稍后就到站的是 地球 地球
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:18.58,1:34:22.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请不要忘记您随身的行李
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:22.39,1:34:24.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请保重
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:32.76,1:34:42.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在海边拾到的这小贝壳\Nで拾った　小さなこの贝が
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:42.84,1:34:48.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么会变成螺旋的形状?\Nどうして涡く形になったのか
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:49.40,1:34:58.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,教晓我的 是你呀\N教えてくれたのは　贵方でした
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:59.55,1:35:09.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是在夜空中闪烁的银河\Nそれは夜空の　闇に辉く银河
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:09.89,1:35:15.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,贝壳听到那声音\Nその波音が贝にはこえて
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:16.78,1:35:25.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被银河迷住了 变成螺旋的形状\N银河に见とれて　涡いたという
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:26.57,1:35:31.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的耳朵\N私の耳も
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:32.30,1:35:35.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有贝壳\N贝の
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:35.62,1:35:44.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也想听到你的声音\N贵方の?がきたいけれど
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:45.65,1:35:53.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是你却比星星还要遥远\N贵方は星より远い人
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:20.65,1:36:29.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我心中感到奇怪\N私の心の不思议さは
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:29.66,1:36:39.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当我静静想起你的时候\N贵方をかに思い出す时
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:39.10,1:36:47.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,心情就如银河般 起伏不定\N银河とおなじ　涡をく

